==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{PIE root|ru|wert}}
{{bor|ru|cu|врѣмѧ}} (but never spelled with {{m|ru||ѣ}} in Russian, perhaps due to the influence of {{cog|orv|веремѧ}}), from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*vermę}} < {{m|sla-pro||*vertmen}}, from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*wertmen}}. Displaced native {{cog|orv|веремѧ}}. Cognate with {{cog|sa|वर्त्मन्|tr=vártman||track, course}}.

See also [[w:pleophony|pleophony]] (CeRC > CeReC) and [[w:liquid metathesis|liquid metathesis]] (CeRC > CReC, CRēC).

